  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Depaul Ukraine Capacity Strengthening and Advocacy 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant to cover Capacity Strengthening and Advocacy activities at Depaul Ukraine between 2025 and 2028, with a goal of leaving Depaul Ukraine in a strong position to sustain activities independently when CAFOD&apos;s Ukraine Programme ends in March 2028. Activities will be based on recommendations from the Capacity Self-Assessment facilitated by DPI and CAFOD with Depaul Ukraine in 2024-25. Funding will be released in successive approvals as action plan and budget are developed iteratively.</narrative>
  </description>
